zone:0:300:0:300:0:5555:you find yourself floating on a cloud, high in the sky. you feel the wind on your face, harsh and pressuring. everywhere you look you find clouds. you will need to land on these clouds as you jump. be careful, for if you do not land on a cloud, you shall fall down to the earth, never able to rise again
