zone:150:300:150:300:5000:5555:to your utter shock, you find an actual building, floating up in the sky. looking around this unbelievable phenomenon, you find various other statues. but unlike the statue which you saw earlier, these clearly depict the creature for which they are build to represent. griffins. everywhere you look, you see large griffin statues looming above you. these statues are made so realisticly that for several moments you think they might actually come to life
