zone:300:300:300:300:5000:5555:a path leading upwards to a huge tower. you might find your hardest challenge above@trackme@
zone:300:300:300:349:5100:5555:the tower is in your sights. it is a quiet place. no human or animal has ever daired to come to this place. what lies inside might be more than you can handel. enter at your own risk
