travelpoint:300:300:350:350:5100:5100:griffins_lair:0:0:5100:what you are about to do has not been done by any other human. here lies the king of the griffins, the strongest creature on the plannet. perhaps it is bravery to fight it, perhaps foolishness. either way, it is going to be the hardest battle of your life
